# TG-04 stage B (make test-tg-socket, at scale 1 and 2): tgd and tg installed from the
# volume's /packages with their saved grants, each program's page listing exactly what it
# holds; tgd serving the window on the socket file in its own directory, with an invented
# account (--synthetic: no TDLib, no network, the code 12345 and the password zoraya,
# which are not credentials of anything); tg started from the terminal as an installed
# window program (overlay 0003), reaching tgd only through its saved +sock grant.
# tg says on the serial line what it shows (the data is synthetic); the terminal is read
# for the shell's lines. Coordinates are logical: tg is the second window, its frame at
# (105, 103), its body at (105, 138), 840 x 520: the list's rows at y = 186 + 62 n.
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
#
# Installed with the words of the report: tgd its own directory, Telegram's nine IPv4
# ranges on 443 and OpenRouter; tg the one socket file.
type install /packages/tgd +own ~/.config/tgd +net 91.108.56.0/22:443 +net 91.108.4.0/22:443 +net 91.108.8.0/22:443 +net 91.108.16.0/22:443 +net 91.108.12.0/22:443 +net 149.154.160.0/20:443 +net 91.105.192.0/23:443 +net 91.108.20.0/22:443 +net 185.76.151.0/24:443 +net openrouter.ai:443\r
screen tgd installed with:
screen   ~/.config/tgd  its own files
screen   net: 91.108.56.0/22:443  reach
screen   net: 91.108.4.0/22:443  reach
screen   net: 91.108.8.0/22:443  reach
screen   net: 91.108.16.0/22:443  reach
screen   net: 91.108.12.0/22:443  reach
screen   net: 149.154.160.0/20:443  reach
screen   net: 91.105.192.0/23:443  reach
screen   net: 91.108.20.0/22:443  reach
screen   net: 185.76.151.0/24:443  reach
screen   net: openrouter.ai:443  reach
screen ~> _
chord ctrl l
top ~> _
type install /packages/tg +sock /data/home/tgd/window.sock\r
screen tg installed with:
screen   /data/home/tgd/window.sock  connect to
screen ~> _
#
# What each holds, saved: exactly the words given, nothing else.
chord ctrl l
top ~> _
type programs tgd\r
prefix tgd is an installed program, /apps/tgd/tgd (sha256
screen   tgclient's backend: TDLib, the stores, the services
screen files:
prefix   tgd
prefix   tgd.cmd
screen saved grants:
screen   +own ~/.config/tgd  ~/.config/tgd  its own files (saved)
screen   +net 91.108.56.0/22:443  net: 91.108.56.0/22:443  reach (saved)
screen   +net 91.108.4.0/22:443  net: 91.108.4.0/22:443  reach (saved)
screen   +net 91.108.8.0/22:443  net: 91.108.8.0/22:443  reach (saved)
screen   +net 91.108.16.0/22:443  net: 91.108.16.0/22:443  reach (saved)
screen   +net 91.108.12.0/22:443  net: 91.108.12.0/22:443  reach (saved)
screen   +net 149.154.160.0/20:443  net: 149.154.160.0/20:443  reach (saved)
screen   +net 91.105.192.0/23:443  net: 91.105.192.0/23:443  reach (saved)
screen   +net 91.108.20.0/22:443  net: 91.108.20.0/22:443  reach (saved)
screen   +net 185.76.151.0/24:443  net: 185.76.151.0/24:443  reach (saved)
screen   +net openrouter.ai:443  net: openrouter.ai:443  reach (saved)
screen ~> _
pause 500
shot tgs-programs-tgd
chord ctrl l
top ~> _
type programs tg\r
prefix tg is an installed program, /apps/tg/tg (sha256
screen   the Telegram window, over tgd's socket
screen files:
prefix   tg
prefix   tg.cmd
screen saved grants:
screen   +sock /data/home/tgd/window.sock  /data/home/tgd/window.sock  connect to (saved)
screen ~> _
pause 500
shot tgs-programs-tg
#
# tgd in the background, serving the invented account; then the window.
chord ctrl l
top ~> _
type tgd --window --synthetic &\r
prefix tgd: the window's socket is
type tg\r
serial tg: login phone
pause 1500
click 500 119
pause 500
shot tgs-login
# The login through the socket: a wrong code is refused by tgd's AuthController.
type 0000\r
then tg: login code
type 00000\r
then tg: login refused: Wrong code
type 12345\r
then tg: login password
type zoraya\r
then tg: ready
serial tg: chats 7 from 0: "Mark Owens"
pause 500
shot tgs-list
#
# The club (row 6): its newest 40 messages, Cyrillic, a photo's placeholder.
click 255 558
then tg: opened "Книжковий клуб": 40 messages, last: Обкладинка
then tg: chat "Книжковий клуб" unread 0
pause 500
shot tgs-chat
type hello over the socket\r
then tg: message "Книжковий клуб" out: hello over the socket
then tg: delivered: hello over the socket
#
# Protocol 3: a send that fails is shown failed (the error mark, "Not sent"), never
# pending; Up from the composer chooses it, Enter sends it again (tgd's resendMessages).
type /fail this one first fails\r
then tg: message "Книжковий клуб" out: /fail this one first fails
then tg: not sent: /fail this one first fails
pause 500
shot tgs-failed
key up
key ret
then tg: retry: /fail this one first fails
then tg: message "Книжковий клуб" out: /fail this one first fails
then tg: delivered: /fail this one first fails
pause 500
shot tgs-retried
#
# tgd's timer: a message to another chat raises its count.
serial tg: chat "Дмитро Шевченко" unread 2: Повідомлення з таймера 1
#
# tgd goes (Ctrl-C in the terminal): the window says so; started again, it is found
# again by itself, and the (invented) login is asked again.
click 85 400
type fg\r
pause 500
chord ctrl c
then tg: waiting: tgd went away
pause 500
shot tgs-gone
type tgd --window --synthetic &\r
then tg: login phone
